{"The `end` variable is incorrectly computed using `slotStartTime` instead of `slotEndTime`, causing both `start` and `end` to have the same value, which allows slots that start within working hours but extend past them to be incorrectly marked as available": 0.9789921641349792, "The comparison `dayjs(date.start).add(utcOffset, \"minutes\") === dayjs(date.end).add(utcOffset, \"minutes\")` uses `===` to compare two Dayjs objects, which compares object references instead of values and always returns false - should use `.isSame()` method instead": 0.9867019057273865, "The working hours check uses `.find()` to return false when a slot is outside ANY working hour block, but the correct logic requires checking if the slot is outside ALL blocks - this causes valid slots to be incorrectly rejected for users with multiple working hour blocks on the same day": 0.9678873419761658}